OL,3,GNEWSAFootballers injured in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run, club says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 38-year-old man was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,8,Fdangerous driving, driving while over
OL,9,Fthe prescribed limit for alcohol and
OL,10,Fcausing grievous bodily harm. He has
OL,11,Fbeen released on bail "pending further
OL,12,Finquiries",
OL,14,FPosting on X, Lutterworth Town FC said
OL,15,Fits players had been hurt in the
OL,16,Fincident.
